      "message": "fix(wallet): Handle abort of transaction removal\n\nAborting a RemoveTxs() transaction invokes an empty std::function, which\nthrows `std::bad_function_call`.\n\nImplement a no-op abort callback since memory changes are deferred until\nafter database commit. Extend RemoveTxs coverage to verify rollback\nrestores the database record and leaves wallet memory unchanged.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "psychemist",
        "email": "ikeagudike@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-10T10:30:19Z"
