        }
      ],
      "message": "fix(wallet): Fix watch-only migration failure\n\nRemoving transactions updates `mapWallet` only after database commit.\nRequiring an empty map beforehand causes migration of legacy wallets\ncontaining only watch-only transactions to fail.\n\nRequire all transactions in map to be those already scheduled for\nremoval. Add regression coverage to ensure transactions and balances are\npreserved after migration and wallet reload without having to rescan\nblockchain",
